{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/a2645cd36352586e8f6bf38bfb8dc69f.avif?t=1756662715\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitors is a social deduction shooter set in a procedurally generated, alien infested space station, where the environment changes every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crewmates will try to repair the station's communication equipment and call for evacuation, while the outnumbered Traitors will use special tools to stop that from happening. Whatever your role, work fast, because the oxygen is running low!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/743c3af0bacdb02f10f2da56e89eb15b.poster.avif?t=1756662715\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/743c3af0bacdb02f10f2da56e89eb15b.webm?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/743c3af0bacdb02f10f2da56e89eb15b.mp4?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every round, the layout of the station is chosen at random, ensuring a high replayability. Most rooms have unique properties, like vending machines, electrical controls or environmental dangers that Traitors can leverage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the locked door to Communications Room and craft the correct keycard at the office in Hangar using resin and the code on the locked door. Repair the communications equipment using the required items, push the red button and hurry back to the Hangar, a rescue ship is arriving and it won't wait too long!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map scales in size as the player count increases.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/aa21040fa3973ce99dbb1bd342471497.avif?t=1756662715\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/fbd140b3e69ec4adc51d9619f924f76f.poster.avif?t=1756662715\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/fbd140b3e69ec4adc51d9619f924f76f.webm?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/fbd140b3e69ec4adc51d9619f924f76f.mp4?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitors are not the only thing to watch out for. Avoid the bigger monsters until you have access to firearms and ammo. Sounds attract enemies, so move slow and stay quiet when moving past them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/d19ef7670eb9dd9361d8617faa0aff86.avif?t=1756662715\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/ed975fa02a5b23c500df42214eb8539f.poster.avif?t=1756662715\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/ed975fa02a5b23c500df42214eb8539f.webm?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/ed975fa02a5b23c500df42214eb8539f.mp4?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push players in awkward positions to their demise, or disarm an armed assailant by making them go ragdoll. If you're not feeling physical, a Taser will get the job done as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/844881181aa4d30045ff8ba7468ac93b.avif?t=1756662715\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/a6f76b4e17262a191f9a33e359bb36c7.poster.avif?t=1756662715\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/a6f76b4e17262a191f9a33e359bb36c7.webm?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/a6f76b4e17262a191f9a33e359bb36c7.mp4?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Information is key. In the Intercom-room, players can transmit their voice to every room in the station.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/88fe31a4270780720b38d75102ff2ae2.avif?t=1756662715\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/d8a182539e5309465208690efd6cfd1d.poster.avif?t=1756662715\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/d8a182539e5309465208690efd6cfd1d.webm?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/d8a182539e5309465208690efd6cfd1d.mp4?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistols, rifles, shotguns, melee weapons and grenade launchers. Firearms and valuable equipment can be found in locked safes. Find a key first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cash from containers, deposit it using a Deposit Machine and use Terminals to order equipment such as Teleport tablets, GPSs, Flashlights, Keys, Oxygen, Medkits and Ammo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitors may use credits to purchase special equipment with instant delivery. This includes time bombs, daggers, disguisers, cleaning kits, mines and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/2a48c646cf87c8a429ce3fc9a474f7cd.poster.avif?t=1756662715\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/2a48c646cf87c8a429ce3fc9a474f7cd.webm?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/2a48c646cf87c8a429ce3fc9a474f7cd.mp4?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A breakdown of key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-12 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated space station layout. Most rooms have unique properties, affecting gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A percentage of players will be Traitors, trying to kill rest of the Crewmates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psycho Killer and Sheriff roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map, objective count and loot scale with player count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and other hazards that attack and harm all players regardless of teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain access to the Communications room and firearms by 3D printing keycards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call for evacuation by repairing the station's radio equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refill your personal oxygen tank at the Oxygen Generator in hangar. When the generator eventually runs out of power, you will have to find or purchase more oxygen to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hosts can customize the server rules, ranging from role and round specific to procedural generation settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does not feature a text chat, requires a microphone to play!<br><br>Join our Discord!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891790?t=1756662715","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756662715","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/6173f6fd82327ed21f381daeb7b466b5efff691a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756662715","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/6173f6fd82327ed21f381daeb7b466b5efff691a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756662715","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains first person player versus player firearm and melee combat with blood. Does not contain gore."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Playtest round 2</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your crew and join the ongoing playtest right now!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/a2645cd36352586e8f6bf38bfb8dc69f.avif?t=1756662715\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitors is a social deduction shooter set in a procedurally generated, alien infested space station, where the environment changes every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crewmates will try to repair the station's communication equipment and call for evacuation, while the outnumbered Traitors will use special tools to stop that from happening. Whatever your role, work fast, because the oxygen is running low!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/743c3af0bacdb02f10f2da56e89eb15b.poster.avif?t=1756662715\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/743c3af0bacdb02f10f2da56e89eb15b.webm?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/743c3af0bacdb02f10f2da56e89eb15b.mp4?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every round, the layout of the station is chosen at random, ensuring a high replayability. Most rooms have unique properties, like vending machines, electrical controls or environmental dangers that Traitors can leverage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the locked door to Communications Room and craft the correct keycard at the office in Hangar using resin and the code on the locked door. Repair the communications equipment using the required items, push the red button and hurry back to the Hangar, a rescue ship is arriving and it won't wait too long!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map scales in size as the player count increases.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/aa21040fa3973ce99dbb1bd342471497.avif?t=1756662715\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/fbd140b3e69ec4adc51d9619f924f76f.poster.avif?t=1756662715\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/fbd140b3e69ec4adc51d9619f924f76f.webm?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/fbd140b3e69ec4adc51d9619f924f76f.mp4?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitors are not the only thing to watch out for. Avoid the bigger monsters until you have access to firearms and ammo. Sounds attract enemies, so move slow and stay quiet when moving past them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/d19ef7670eb9dd9361d8617faa0aff86.avif?t=1756662715\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/ed975fa02a5b23c500df42214eb8539f.poster.avif?t=1756662715\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/ed975fa02a5b23c500df42214eb8539f.webm?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/ed975fa02a5b23c500df42214eb8539f.mp4?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push players in awkward positions to their demise, or disarm an armed assailant by making them go ragdoll. If you're not feeling physical, a Taser will get the job done as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/844881181aa4d30045ff8ba7468ac93b.avif?t=1756662715\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/a6f76b4e17262a191f9a33e359bb36c7.poster.avif?t=1756662715\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/a6f76b4e17262a191f9a33e359bb36c7.webm?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/a6f76b4e17262a191f9a33e359bb36c7.mp4?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Information is key. In the Intercom-room, players can transmit their voice to every room in the station.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/88fe31a4270780720b38d75102ff2ae2.avif?t=1756662715\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/d8a182539e5309465208690efd6cfd1d.poster.avif?t=1756662715\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/d8a182539e5309465208690efd6cfd1d.webm?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/d8a182539e5309465208690efd6cfd1d.mp4?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistols, rifles, shotguns, melee weapons and grenade launchers. Firearms and valuable equipment can be found in locked safes. Find a key first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cash from containers, deposit it using a Deposit Machine and use Terminals to order equipment such as Teleport tablets, GPSs, Flashlights, Keys, Oxygen, Medkits and Ammo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitors may use credits to purchase special equipment with instant delivery. This includes time bombs, daggers, disguisers, cleaning kits, mines and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/2a48c646cf87c8a429ce3fc9a474f7cd.poster.avif?t=1756662715\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/2a48c646cf87c8a429ce3fc9a474f7cd.webm?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/2a48c646cf87c8a429ce3fc9a474f7cd.mp4?t=1756662715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A breakdown of key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-12 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated space station layout. Most rooms have unique properties, affecting gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A percentage of players will be Traitors, trying to kill rest of the Crewmates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psycho Killer and Sheriff roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map, objective count and loot scale with player count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and other hazards that attack and harm all players regardless of teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain access to the Communications room and firearms by 3D printing keycards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call for evacuation by repairing the station's radio equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refill your personal oxygen tank at the Oxygen Generator in hangar. When the generator eventually runs out of power, you will have to find or purchase more oxygen to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hosts can customize the server rules, ranging from role and round specific to procedural generation settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does not feature a text chat, requires a microphone to play!<br><br>Join our Discord!</p>","developers":["Wandering Wavelengths"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/5e98797a0d3d1003614b529872cf0147a5c30d15/header.jpg?t=1756662715","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac